# Large model files - download separately
*.gguf
**/tokenizer.json

# WASM build artifacts — vendored from the candle fork, not built in this repo.
# Rebuild in the candle repo (wasm-pack) and copy the pkg into
# browser-qwen/src/frontend/public/assets/wasm/. The **/ anchoring is required so
# these match under browser-qwen/ (a root-anchored path like src/frontend/... does not).
**/assets/wasm/*.wasm
**/assets/wasm/*.js
**/assets/wasm/snippets/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Package lock files
# package-lock.json
# yarn.lock